$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tonatf  LOC_AFTER=?

* toNat is a function from the bit words to the nonnegative integers.

s1::df-tonat |- toNat = ( l e. Word 2o |-> sum_ i e. { i e. ( 0 ..^ ( # ` l ) ) | ( l ` i ) = 1o } ( 2 ^ i ) )
s2::tonatval |- ( l e. Word 2o -> ( toNat ` l ) = sum_ i e. { i e. ( 0 ..^ ( # ` l ) ) | ( l ` i ) = 1o } ( 2 ^ i ) )
s3::tonatcl |- ( l e. Word 2o -> ( toNat ` l ) e. NN0 )
s4:s2,s3:eqeltrrd |- ( l e. Word 2o -> sum_ i e. { i e. ( 0 ..^ ( # ` l ) ) | ( l ` i ) = 1o } ( 2 ^ i ) e. NN0 )
qed:s1,s4:fmpti |- toNat : Word 2o --> NN0
$)
